"entity": {
"name": "Blue Owl Capital Corporation",
"description": "Blue Owl Capital Corp. seeks investment opportunities in middle market companies located in the United States with an EBITDA of USD 10-250 million and revenues of USD 50-2500 million. The fund focuses on broad range of sectors and industries. It provides financing in the form of senior secured, unsecured loans, subordinated loans, mezzanine loans, and to a lesser extent, equity-related securities & warrants for growth, acquisitions, market, product expansion, re-financings and recapitalizations with an investment size of USD 20-250 million. It also acts as a lead investor. The company was founded on October 15, 2015 and is headquartered in New York, NY.",
